{"id":"f0b0fd432c3af58f","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-free-forgetful.md","title":"Free–Forgetful Adjunction","display":"thm-free-forgetful — Free–Forgetful Adjunction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-free-forgetful","aliases":["58-thm-free-forgetful"],"display":"thm-free-forgetful — Free–Forgetful Adjunction","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-free.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-adjoint-functors.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-free-forgetful"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-free-forgetful</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-free-forgetful — Free–Forgetful Adjunction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"797ed4ec0ca2a08f\" href=\"?note=797ed4ec0ca2a08f\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-free.md\">../batch08/58-df-free.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f12377a238966b6a\" href=\"?note=f12377a238966b6a\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md\">../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dfa5042443233c40\" href=\"?note=dfa5042443233c40\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-adjoint-functors.md\">../batch11/58-df-adjoint-functors.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathbf{Set}\\to\\mathbf{Grp}\">\\(F:\\mathbf{Set}\\to\\mathbf{Grp}\\)</span> (functor assigning a free group)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathbf{Set},\\mathbf{Grp})\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathbf{Set},\\mathbf{Grp})\\)</span> (functor predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:\\mathbf{Grp}\\to\\mathbf{Set}\">\\(U:\\mathbf{Grp}\\to\\mathbf{Set}\\)</span> (forgetful functor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f12377a238966b6a\" href=\"?note=f12377a238966b6a\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md\">../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_S:S\\to U(F(S))\">\\(\\iota_S:S\\to U(F(S))\\)</span> (unit map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeObject}_S(F(S),S,U,\\mathbf{Grp},\\iota_S)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeObject}_S(F(S),S,U,\\mathbf{Grp},\\iota_S)\\)</span> (free-object predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"797ed4ec0ca2a08f\" href=\"?note=797ed4ec0ca2a08f\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-free.md\">../batch08/58-df-free.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Forgetful}_S(U,\\mathbf{Grp})\">\\(\\mathrm{Forgetful}_S(U,\\mathbf{Grp})\\)</span> (forgetful-functor predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(F,U,\\mathbf{Set},\\mathbf{Grp})\">\\(\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(F,U,\\mathbf{Set},\\mathbf{Grp})\\)</span> (adjunction predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}free\\text{-}forgetful}\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathbf{Set},\\mathbf{Grp})\\land\n\\mathrm{Forgetful}_S(U,\\mathbf{Grp})\\land\n\\forall S\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Set})\\;\n\\mathrm{FreeObject}_S(F(S),S,U,\\mathbf{Grp},\\iota_S)\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(F,U,\\mathbf{Set},\\mathbf{Grp})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}free\\text{-}forgetful}\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathbf{Set},\\mathbf{Grp})\\land\n\\mathrm{Forgetful}_S(U,\\mathbf{Grp})\\land\n\\forall S\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Set})\\;\n\\mathrm{FreeObject}_S(F(S),S,U,\\mathbf{Grp},\\iota_S)\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(F,U,\\mathbf{Set},\\mathbf{Grp})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The adjunction's unit, counit, naturality, and triangle identities are supplied by the registered adjoint-functor predicate.</li>\n<li>The category argument required by both upstream predicates is explicit; the earlier four-place/free and unary/forgetful calls were signature mismatches.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-free.md","status":"resolved","id":"797ed4ec0ca2a08f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-free.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md","status":"resolved","id":"f12377a238966b6a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-adjoint-functors.md","status":"resolved","id":"dfa5042443233c40","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-adjoint-functors.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md","status":"resolved","id":"f12377a238966b6a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U:\\mathbf{Grp}\\to\\mathbf{Set}$ (forgetful functor, see [[../batch16/58-df-forgetful.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-free.md","status":"resolved","id":"797ed4ec0ca2a08f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FreeObject}_S(F(S),S,U,\\mathbf{Grp},\\iota_S)$ (free-object predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-free.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F:\\mathbf{Set}\\to\\mathbf{Grp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathbf{Set},\\mathbf{Grp})","display":false},{"tex":"U:\\mathbf{Grp}\\to\\mathbf{Set}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_S:S\\to U(F(S))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FreeObject}_S(F(S),S,U,\\mathbf{Grp},\\iota_S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Forgetful}_S(U,\\mathbf{Grp})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(F,U,\\mathbf{Set},\\mathbf{Grp})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}free\\text{-}forgetful}\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathbf{Set},\\mathbf{Grp})\\land\n\\mathrm{Forgetful}_S(U,\\mathbf{Grp})\\land\n\\forall S\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Set})\\;\n\\mathrm{FreeObject}_S(F(S),S,U,\\mathbf{Grp},\\iota_S)\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Adjoint}_S(F,U,\\mathbf{Set},\\mathbf{Grp})","display":true}],"bytes":1591,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4168","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-thm-free-forgetful.md|58-thm-free-forgetful]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["797ed4ec0ca2a08f","f12377a238966b6a","dfa5042443233c40","e637becf421e4e61"]}